      "writtenOn": "2026-11-06T06:54:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As you say, the intention here would then be to contribute to the `jj gerrit upload` an option to not create a `Change-Id` footer, which would eventually become the default once we deem Gerrit\u0027s support for JJ change-id to be good enough. I already have such patch in my fork of JJ and I\u0027ll polish it and contribute it upstream once this series is merged.\n\nHowever, if a `Change-Id` footer is present, it will take priority over the header, so if you have ongoing work you can simply keep the `Change-Id` in the footer and your change will stay the same.\n\nDoes this answer your concern?",
      "parentUuid": "d3042c50_2d2dc620",
      "revId": "17c127e740db54df6973d19b2757dac95c3a46fa",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
