      "writtenOn": "2026-11-06T08:10:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But `xyz` would still have the footer in this scenario?\n\nI see the general point you\u0027re trying to make, but I think it\u0027s a minor concern tbh. There\u0027s already a well known bug in Gerrit where a change with the same change `Change-Id` footer can create two separate changes.\n\nIt\u0027s something we could look at in the future, but I\u0027d be happy to get to a point where we have this problem first.",
